@startuml use-cases
!include style.iuml
left to right direction
title LazyFinance — Use Cases / Scenarios View (+1)

actor "Account owner" as Owner
actor "External MCP client" as Client <<external client>>
actor "Firebase Auth" as Firebase <<identity provider>>
actor "Fintoc" as Fintoc <<banking provider>>
actor "Configured model" as Model <<model provider>>

rectangle "LazyFinance — implemented Stage B system" as System {
  usecase "UC-01\n<b>Access my workspace</b>\nSign in, restore/logout and\nmanage supported credentials" as Access <<security>>
  usecase "UC-02\n<b>Manage and trace finances</b>\nMovements, tags, income, budgets,\nmeasured savings and evidence" as Finance
  usecase "UC-03\n<b>Connect / synchronize a bank</b>\nExplicit link, import, refresh,\nrelink and disconnect" as Bank <<banking>>
  usecase "UC-04\n<b>Ask grounded text questions</b>\nPeriods, uncertainty, references\nand bounded saved history" as Chat <<assistant>>
  usecase "UC-05\n<b>Review an exact saved proposal</b>\nExplicit saved-version\napprove / edit / cancel" as Approve <<assistant>>
  usecase "UC-06\n<b>Delegate / revoke client access</b>\nRead permission; optional writes\ndefault off" as Grants <<security>>
  usecase "UC-07\n<b>Use owned MCP reads</b>\nFinancial and supporting tools\nwith OAuth authorization" as Reads <<domain>>
  usecase "UC-08\n<b>Execute bounded MCP changes</b>\nGranted scopes, stable request ID\nand preview for existing-record changes" as Writes <<domain>>
}

Owner -- Access
Owner -- Finance
Owner -- Bank
Owner -- Chat
Owner -- Approve
Owner -- Grants
Client -- Grants
Client -- Reads
Client -- Writes
Access -- Firebase
Bank -- Fintoc
Chat -- Model

legend bottom
  Model proposals are not approval. UI card approval and MCP execution have independent authority.
  Consent is owner/client-bound; writes default off. No money movement or autonomous bank refresh.
  Voice / forecasting / broader MCP management are not delivered. Deployment is pending.
endlegend
@enduml
